# ── ML model weights & training corpora ───────────────────────────────────────
# These routinely exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit and are reproducible
# artifacts, not source. Ignoring them keeps a monorepo commit from silently
# dragging hundreds of MB into history — which is easy to do here, because the
# repo root holds jarvis alongside ph_economic_ai and a pathspec-less
# `git commit` picks up whatever happens to be staged.
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
pytorch_model*.bin
model*.bin
adapter_model.bin
optimizer.pt
scheduler.pt
rng_state.pth
scaler.pt

# Fine-tuning corpora and checkpoints
jarvis/Training/
jarvis/**/checkpoint-*/
jarvis/deepseek-*/
jarvis/jarvis-lora-adapter/
